STATEMENT #2: Society Complaint Triage
User: Housing Society Committee Volunteers (~100 flats)

Challenge: How might we take messy resident complaints and use AI to sort, prioritise, and track them until they are resolved?

Context:
A housing society committee of volunteers receives complaints about water, lifts, parking, noise, and cleaning through chat messages. They pile up, repeat, and urgent ones get buried.

Constraint:
There are around 100 flats, complaints come in mixed English and Hindi, and committee members can spare only a few minutes a day.